<title>UK: DG HYPO SETS 100 MLN MARK STRUCTURED BOND.</title>
<headline>DG HYPO SETS 100 MLN MARK STRUCTURED BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    28.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    28.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    HAMBURG   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.125</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR 10 PCT</p>
<p>		MINUS ONE TIMES 12 MONTH LIBOR.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 778</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
